WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.130
It will not be determined until they battle.

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:07.320
The conclusion to these fierce battles with the fate of the entire continent is finally at hand.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.160
Much blood and many tears have been shed; however, only one will take the throne.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.160
A Queen's Blade battle the likes of which no one has ever seen is about to begin...

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:24.000
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.630
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:44.060
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.980
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:57.320
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:05.040
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:09.460
In order to become

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:14.630
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.720
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:25.980
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:32.020
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:39.030
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:51.010
Cattleya-san!

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.030
It's exactly as Rana-chan said.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:58.220
How frightful...

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.520
What a sinister room.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.960
So you were the one who manipulated the Kouma Ninja from behind the scenes...

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:15.040
to attack Hinomoto, were you not?

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:17.650
Queen Aldra!

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.680
Queen Aldra.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:29.590
I, Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe...

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:33.670
have come here from the concealed region to the east of the continent.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.540
I have an inquiry for Her Majesty.

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:39.590
Let me hear it.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:43.140
Why... why did you assault Hinomoto?

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:48.770
Why did you manipulate the Kouma ninja to attack the secluded Hinomoto?

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.850
I wish for you to tell me!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.400
To search for my little sister.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.650
Little sister?!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:03.320
I have spent many years searching for her throughout the continent, to no avail.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:07.490
What remained was the location my rule could not reach: Hinomoto.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.830
T-That is the only reason you attacked Hinomoto?!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.040
The only reason?!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.080
That's everything to me!

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:20.090
If I can find her, it does not matter to me if Hinomoto is turned to ashes!

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.470
I don't expect anyone to understand.

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:27.020
Simply for being half-demon, half-human,

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.930
We were shunned,

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.740
neglected,

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.850
and driven from our human hometown.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.600
We spent many days wandering aimlessly.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.320
Nevertheless, I continued to live on.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:41.550
Everything was for the sake of protecting my little sister.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.100
Then one day, she suddenly...

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.670
disappeared from right in front of me.

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.780
Perhaps she was abducted.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.290
However, the one thing I know for sure is that she still lives.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.290
I can feel it in my chest.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.580
Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:03.510
Become my subordinate, last warrior of Hinomoto.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:08.430
And seize the abductor of my little sister in my stead.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:12.430
If you do that, no more harm shall befall Hinomoto.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.130
That isn't a bad proposal.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.370
Thank you...

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.370
Shizuka-san.

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.250
Vance will be the only Queen...

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.960
that I will allow to govern Hinomoto!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:52.470
I also cannot forgive you for using your demonic abilities to possess Risty-san!

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.350
Will you cut me down?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.750
No.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.630
The snake has already lost its fangs.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.860
I've entrusted Vagrant Warrior Leina with my wishes.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.900
What remains is but one conclusion to Queen's Blade.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.520
Amusing words.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:12.240
You think that Leina will struggle until she faces me?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.040
Inevitably.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:16.880
Very well.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.690
I wonder where the great archangel disappeared to?

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:31.640
I wonder if she forgot about the night service?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.770
Don't tell me she returned to heaven?!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:40.790
<i>The precious divine milk that the Head Angel
entrusted me with was stolen by that flabby pink!</i>

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:44.030
<i>I can't return to heaven like this!</i>

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.150
She couldn't have...

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.180
Gather around, everyone!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.720
The sword that magnificently overcame the Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe...

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.670
The Vagrant Warrior, Leina's favorite!

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.330
The Blade of Ewindel!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.250
or something that looks like it.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.940
The clearance sale starts now!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:00.940
I'll take one!

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.530
Ah, Give me one too!

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:03.910
When did she...

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.130
We just finished making them.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.160
They only look the same, though. They're pretty cheap.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.430
She's still got that strong business spirit, huh?

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:22.690
Rana...

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.320
I'll certainly defeat the Queen.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:25.820
I'll win...

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:31.100
and rescue your father and mother without fail.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:52.550
At last, the only remaining participants of
Queen's Blade are me, Risty, and Queen Aldra.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:58.160
Not even Claudette was a match for her.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:03.760
She'll certainly be aiming for your life.

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.940
Directly, and without hesitation.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.610
Risty, what on earth happened to you?

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:23.540
It's the good luck coin.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.920
Hold on. This is the same on both sides!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.590
Isn't it interesting? It's a nice trick.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.220
You're right, Risty.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.590
It really is interesting.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:36.630
I've come all this way thanks to this lucky coin.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.520
The chosen one for this occasion is...

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.640
J-Just a moment!

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.610
This is...

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:00.710
Risty!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:06.290
L-Long time no see, Risty.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.910
Hey! Where's my order?

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.130
Oh, y-yes! Right away!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.760
Elina-sama, it's beginning.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.640
I know that.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:23.440
Win...

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.350
Leina onee-chan.

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.610
Leina!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.180
Risty!

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:50.350
The Risty I know...

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.920
doesn't have such cold eyes!

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:08.060
It's thanks to them that I lost my body.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.890
And you...

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.790
A forest.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.560
If we go there...

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.240
Hold on. Hang in there!

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:19.840
Wait here.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.700
I'll go look for water now.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.420
Where is...

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.870
the water?

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.960
I brought water!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:39.840
Where?

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.540
Where are you?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:48.980
This can't... I told you to wait...

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.270
If you're gone...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.560
I...

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.800
I can't keep on living!

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.650
That's right. You lost your little sister.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:08.450
We happened to meet in the dark abyss called despair.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.660
My beloved Aldra.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:19.500
Thus, I entered your lovely body...

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:23.930
and you obtained eternal perfection.

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:27.450
We two became one.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.850
You don't need to trust anyone else.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:33.480
You only need to believe in me.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.810
<i>There isn't enough to go around, so it can't be helped.</i>

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.560
<i>I finally caught up to you.</i>

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.790
<i>A weakling like you wants to enter
Queen's Blade? Stop messing around!</i>

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:28.170
<i>When you take control of your life, I'll be taking it back from you.</i>

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:29.250
Risty.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.280
No, this is wrong!

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:39.130
Risty isn't like that!

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.300
Leina, are you throwing away your life?!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.510
Don't, Onee-chan!

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:50.290
Risty, you're very important to me.
You taught me the meaning of fighting.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:51.530
You're someone I love!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.900
You're a precious friend, so...

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.690
please, Risty! Remember!

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.770
Risty!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:32.050
Come back, Risty.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.510
Risty!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:45.470
Leina.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:48.990
Risty.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:52.910
That's right! It's Leina! You recognize me, right?

00:12:57.930 --> 00:13:00.560
You damn cunning human...

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:03.410
Risty's soul should be roaming about the underworld...

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:08.770
That cursed Leina should be suffering, yet she's enjoying herself.

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.930
It seems that the plan backfired.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:16.270
However, there is no need to worry, my beloved Aldra.

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:19.840
Kill.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.610
Don't think about anything.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.350
Kill the enemy in front of your eyes.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:26.410
Risty?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:28.490
Kill.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.010
Kill.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.000
Kill.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.430
Kill!

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.120
Risty...

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.920
Don't do...

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.190
something like this.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.760
Kill! Kill!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.270
Risty...

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:04.190
Risty.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:09.830
Weren't you fighting for those children?

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:16.440
You shouldn't be showing them something like this!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.920
Don't be led astray, my controlled servant, Risty!

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:26.120
Shut up.

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:31.090
Shut up!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.770
Onee-chan is dying!

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.230
This is bad!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:46.970
You sword isn't one that kills; it is a sword that revives.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:50.650
I, too, was saved thanks to that sword.

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:54.990
Only you can save Risty-san.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.020
You mustn't lose under any circumstances.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.840
It's over, huh?

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:03.350
So you're up to your usual tricks, are you?

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.230
Y-You...

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.260
Caught you!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.280
What?!

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:15.680
Oh, what have we here?

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:21.600
This must have been worth my trouble if you're <i>this</i> agitated...

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.140
Not yet, Risty!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.080
Kill!

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:54.050
Risty, I'll accept your wishes, too!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.780
Victor: Vagrant Warrior, Leina!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.620
She did it!

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:13.320
She won!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.740
Congratulations, Elina-sama!

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.660
Of course.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.370
Leina onee-chan was obviously going to win.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.290
Leina-san, that was magnificent.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.080
Hey, lady! I need more sake!

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.460
Hurry it up! We need to make a cheer here!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.490
Ah, yes! Right away!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.730
Melpha.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.440
Archangel-sama?

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.330
I've been worried about you.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.640
Where have you hidden yourself?

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.560
I returned to heaven for a bit.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.280
Heaven?

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:51.950
Yeah. I have a favor to ask you.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:55.460
Make sure to listen carefully!

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:56.440
Yes.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:58.570
Risty.

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:00.830
Pull yourself together, Risty!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.990
Leina...

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:06.450
Thank goodness you're back.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:10.780
I'm in your debt again, Leina...

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:17.370
Risty...

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.760
This is the end!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.720
Too bad for that shadow, too.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:29.160
"That shadow" is such a fine greeting, eh?

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.860
Giving up one's flesh certainly has its discomforts.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.410
I know.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:39.530
Because of that, you turned Cattleya and her husband into hard stone.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.680
I've seen through everything.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:45.170
Well then, bye bye.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:46.290
Fool.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:58.410
That surprised me.

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.990
Seems like you lost the divine milk.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.430
Minions!

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.780
Hey, stop it!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:20.130
Your pranks end here.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.470
Be devoured, just like that.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:26.240
Shit! You're just lowly demons!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.580
My beloved Aldra.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.540
It's about time to finish this.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.380
I'll give you a present.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.670
<i>This</i> is how you use your trump card.

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:43.450
I'm called the Assassin of Innumerable Changes for a reason, you know.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.710
How does that divine milk taste?

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.020
I did it!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.560
With that, Queen's Blade is over.

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:58.090
So that wasn't enough to kill me, it seems...

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.250
Hmm...

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.900
If this person is Aldra's underling,

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.610
she should have returned to the palace...

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:20.260
But you both came here together...

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:26.430
Anyway, right now, I'm just happy that the old Risty's back.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:33.740
Come now! At last, the final battle of Queen's Blade has arrived!

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:36.440
The event that will decide the continent's next Queen.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.060
The ferocious quadrennial duel!

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:45.110
Whether you're entering the contest grounds or not, it won't begin unless you bet!

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:47.910
Here, we have the current queen, Aldra!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:52.950
Her strength, along with her many mysteries, are well known to all of you.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.850
Her weapon: The Demonsblade.

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:59.260
And here, we have the challenger!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.340
<i>The</i> Vance family's second daughter.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.580
The Vagrant Warrior, Leina!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:06.930
Her weapon is also something to be feared!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.270
Crafted in Steel Mountain,

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:12.770
its name is the wind of triumph: The Blade of Ewindel.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.310
Come! Place your bets!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.820
50 silver pieces on Aldra!

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:17.400
100 here!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.320
Claudette.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.240
Are you alright now?

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.910
Yes. I'm fine.

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:30.500
Thank goodness.

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:35.160
You had me worried there.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:38.040
Are you anxious?

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:42.310
Yes... very.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.890
I guess I have to finish things, huh.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.560
<i>Leina.</i>

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:54.310
<i>I'll show you that I can change our country... no, this continent.</i>

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:57.270
It shouldn't be me.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:03.620
It really should be you instead of me, Onee-sama...

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.110
It's finally time?

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:17.830
Onee-sama?

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:22.180
Do not doubt any longer. The time for hesitation has already passed.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.590
Now...

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:27.290
Now, think only of winning.

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:29.500
Okay.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.430
I'll be going.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.570
Welcome back, master.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:50.950
I'll devotedly and wholeheartedly serve you from now on.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.040
But we have to postpone that for a bit.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.750
Since I'll be taking much of your vitality from now on.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.170
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.060
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:05.760
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:07.550
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:08.930
Such erotic actions.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.600
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.390
Yes.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.720
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.470
Really?

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:15.350
Most likely.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.060
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:20.650
Did you call? It's Airi.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:22.980
My heroic race is lovely, don't you agree?

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.370
I'll be greeting my master

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.610
with a Welcome home again today.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:30.030
If I'm appointed with a task,

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.550
I won't voice any discontent.

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.740
No matter what rumors the neighbors may spread,

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:37.460
I will always remain completely obedient.

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:42.340
She's useless unless she takes the life force of beautiful women.

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:50.010
That physical condition really is a pain.

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:53.100
I have an eerie body.

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:55.600
I'll always be by your side.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:57.480
This lipstick is romantic,

00:22:57.480 --> 00:22:59.730
and my lips are sweetly dramatic.

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:02.650
Now, I'll be accompanying you

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:05.030
on a wonderful journey through the underworld.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:07.030
Before my body becomes transparent

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:10.200
I'll be having my fill.

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:15.330
Well, it's been a long road.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:17.910
But, Queen's blade is finally at its last episode. Its very last!

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:19.920
Don't you think "last" has a nice ring to it?

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:20.620
Do you understand?

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:23.500
I've had a lot of "last" experiences up until now, too.

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:25.420
Especially when I was traveling with Leina,

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:26.670
using her as a puppet, and manipulating her...{behind the scenes...}

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.420
I think that was a fitting end!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:31.320
The weakest, good-for-nothing warrior, Leina,

00:23:31.320 --> 00:23:33.410
defeated a formidable enemy, and finally faces the Queen.

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:34.420
Super Moe!{How exciting!}

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.220
I'm also feeling exited and it's moving me to tears!

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:39.250
Queen's Blade: Final Episode!

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:41.090
Ambition! Successor to the Throne.

00:23:41.090 --> 00:23:43.400
And here come the tears!
